     4749         assign
     4750           varcur-base      = varcur-base      / varcur-fact-qnty
     4751           varcur-road-tax  = varcur-road-tax  / varcur-fact-qnty
     4752           varcur-excise    = varcur-excise    / varcur-fact-qnty
     4753         .
